### Register
POST http://localhost:3003/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "max@test.com",
    "password": "password123"
}

### Login
POST http://localhost:3003/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "max@test.com",
    "password": "password123"
}

